      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the help. i noticed the sheet does actually exist though. i checked the tab name and it's spelled exactly the same. i'm still getting the error on that same line. maybe i should try a different way to copy it? what else could be causing it?",
      "source": "evaluator"
